{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他越来越在意对方，想靠近的愿望也更迫切。亲近早已成了他能依靠的安稳，因此他更想让两人的关系深入一些。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他对这段亲近的依恋加深，更想让两人的相处继续深入。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文已确立亲近成为他可以依靠的安稳，因此将此刻的迫切解释为依恋加深、渴望更深入的关系，因果连贯。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选11\",\n        \"候选12\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他越在意对方，越盼对方真正懂得自己的心意。因为他长久少有被真正理解的经验，亲近越深，这个旧愿望越显得要紧。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他在亲近中更迫切地盼望自己的心意被真正理解。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文明确留下了被理解的需要仍未着落的经历，因此把此刻的迫切解释为旧愿望随着亲近加深而变得更重要，有直接的历史依据。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选11\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d9f9be10-9d15-4f7c-b638-2e005905295a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T021017329589Z", "elapsed_seconds": 325.172, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:15:42.509578+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8b1e5c1b28bd27144260086b80a514c397fe3080047c273d41121e7171bb6573", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457c